Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "nombre": "Norte",
  "capacidad": 5,
  "ubicacion": "Piso 6"
}

### Mismo horario en otra sala
@salaHorarioId = {{crearSalaHorario.response.body.id}}
POST {{base}}/api/reservas
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "usuarioId": {{usuarioId}},
  "salaId": {{salaHorarioId}},
  "fechaInicio": "2026-12-01T10:00:00.000Z",
  "fechaFin": "2026-12-01T11:00:00.000Z"
}

### Listar reservas
GET {{base}}/api/reservas
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Filtrar reservas por sala
GET {{base}}/api/reservas?salaId={{salaId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Filtrar reservas por usuario
GET {{base}}/api/reservas?usuarioId={{usuarioId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Reserva inexistente
GET {{base}}/api/reservas/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Consultar reserva
@reservaId = {{crearReserva.response.body.id}}
GET {{base}}/api/reservas/{{reservaId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Comentario con texto vacío
POST {{base}}/api/reservas/{{reservaId}}/comentarios
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "texto": "   "
}

### Comentario de reserva inexistente
POST {{base}}/api/reservas/999999/comentarios
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "texto": "No existe"
}

### Crear comentario
POST {{base}}/api/reservas/{{reservaId}}/comentarios
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "texto": "Llegaré cinco minutos antes"
}

### Segundo comentario
POST {{base}}/api/reservas/{{reservaId}}/comentarios
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "texto": "Confirmo el proyector"
}

### Listar comentarios
GET {{base}}/api/reservas/{{reservaId}}/comentarios
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Comentarios de reserva inexistente
GET {{base}}/api/reservas/999999/comentarios
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Cancelar reserva inexistente
DELETE {{base}}/api/reservas/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Cancelar reserva
DELETE {{base}}/api/reservas/{{reservaId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Volver a reservar el horario liberado
POST {{base}}/api/reservas
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "usuarioId": {{usuarioId}},
  "salaId": {{salaId}},
  "fechaInicio": "2026-12-01T10:00:00.000Z",
  "fechaFin": "2026-12-01T11:00:00.000Z"
}

### Ruta inexistente
GET {{base}}/api/no-existe
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

